    <string name="saver_title">Use Dremo as a screensaver</string>
    <string name="saver_intro">Dremo can run as the TV\'s screensaver. Where you turn it on depends on your TV.</string>
    <string name="saver_older_title">Android TV 11 and older (Mi Box S, Shield, many Xiaomi TVs)</string>
    <string name="saver_older_body">Open the TV\'s Settings, then Device Preferences, then Screen saver, and choose Dremo.</string>
    <string name="saver_google_title">Google TV (Android 12 and newer)</string>
    <string name="saver_google_body">Google TV removed the screensaver picker, but the setting still works. Turn on Developer options and Network debugging on the TV, connect from a computer with adb, and run:</string>
    <string name="saver_restore_title">To go back to the Google TV screensaver, run:</string>
    <string name="saver_note">The screensaver shows: %1$s. Change the scene in Settings. It has no sound unless you turn on Sound in screensaver.</string>

